Notes for submission
- `CaptureLogger` and `logging` come from `transformers.testing_utils` / `transformers.utils`; both test
  files already import `torch_device` from `transformers.testing_utils`.
- The tester's `prepare_config_and_inputs_for_common` currently builds its config without passing
  `dropout`; if a tester passes `dropout=0.1` explicitly, drop that argument in the same PR.
- The `# Copied from` marker keeps `utils/check_copies.py` happy; run `make fix-copies`.
- Separate hub PRs (not in this diff): `facebook/musicgen-small`, `-medium`, `-large`, `-melody`,
  `-melody-large`, `-stereo-*`: set `"decoder": {"dropout": 0.0, ...}` and add
  `"decoder_start_token_id": 2048` so `model(**inputs, labels=...)` works out of the box.
